[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3781.91, "timestamp": "01:03:01", "text": "嗯，光标在中间。你看到一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3785.75, "timestamp": "01:03:05", "text": "出现一个红色圆圈。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3787.91, "timestamp": "01:03:07", "text": "距离枪响还有多少时间？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3791.27, "timestamp": "01:03:11", "text": "果酱。就像降温一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3800.23, "timestamp": "01:03:20", "text": "左上角还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3803.029, "timestamp": "01:03:23", "text": "一些基本信息，包括 CNN。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3805.99, "timestamp": "01:03:25", "text": "CNN是权威。这就是子弹的数量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3811.91, "timestamp": "01:03:31", "text": "现在，先从最基本的事情开始。你想试试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3814.15, "timestamp": "01:03:34", "text": "如何着陆？你想弄清楚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3817.43, "timestamp": "01:03:37", "text": "降落？当然可以。好的。我们会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3820.15, "timestamp": "01:03:40", "text": "在一条大路上。回转。你告诉我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3824.27, "timestamp": "01:03:44", "text": "当你见到我的时候。你看我？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3827.109, "timestamp": "01:03:47", "text": "是的。好了，慢点。减少你的"}]